|-
| <code>$wgLayersBindingReadMaxAge</code> || integer || <code>300</code> || Maximum seconds of anonymous public caching for a current-revision binding read. <code>0</code> disables this caching. Logged-in, historical, snapshot, control, viewer/editor, error and private-wiki responses are not publicly cached.
|-
