== Verification and milestone order ==
Use exact-commit CI and the current release matrix, not old test counts or code-size totals, to assess this candidate. Scoped native desktop, upgrade, HTTP and server-performance evidence exists; remaining security/data, device/version, reference-performance and owner acceptance stays open. No formal WCAG or physical Print conformance is claimed.

The binding order is '''page ownership/native history; built-in layer-text search; Cargo readiness; Cargo integration; then layer-object links on wiki-page images, slides and PDF pages'''. Object links are excluded from the lightbox. Existing Cargo gallery/field helpers remain; their presence does not qualify the later milestones or authorize new architecture.

